WEBVTT

00:01:26.280 --> 00:01:30.920
The Scholar and the Emperor

00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:37.800
I, student Meng Tinghui,

00:01:37.880 --> 00:01:39.880
Accuse An Rulan, top metropolitan scholar,

00:01:39.960 --> 00:01:41.240
Of stealing my policy essay.

00:01:41.320 --> 00:01:42.920
I ask the governor to deliver justice.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:44.240
Confucius said,

00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:46.000
“Think thrice before acting.”

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:49.000
Twice is enough.

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:51.680
You spread this essay throughout the capital

00:01:51.760 --> 00:01:53.240
And caused an uproar across the city.

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:54.680
Do you have any proof?

00:01:54.760 --> 00:01:56.640
Your Excellency may summon An Rulan

00:01:56.720 --> 00:01:57.720
To confront me here in court.

00:01:58.280 --> 00:01:59.200
Your Excellency,

00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:01.320
Those commoners outside

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:02.920
Were all brought here by her.

00:02:05.240 --> 00:02:06.200
Summon Scholar An.

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:40.720
An Rulan, top metropolitan scholar, greets Your Excellency.

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:43.360
No need for ceremony, Scholar An.

00:02:43.440 --> 00:02:45.920
I have prepared the seat of honor for you.

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:47.280
Please, take your seat.

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:48.480
Jiang Mei'er?

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:50.400
What are you doing here?

00:02:53.920 --> 00:02:56.760
Second Master, that bitch Meng Tinghui

00:02:57.520 --> 00:02:59.240
Got my uncle and Hall Master Feng killed.

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:02.720
I wish I could devour her flesh

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:04.680
And sleep upon her skin.

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:10.600
Where is she now?

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:12.840
She ranked first in the provincial exam

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:14.640
And will soon come to the capital.

00:03:14.720 --> 00:03:16.440
I know how to deal with her.

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:19.640
Help me, Second Master,

00:03:20.440 --> 00:03:22.560
And you'll be avenging the chief

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:24.680
And earning great merit.

00:03:32.640 --> 00:03:34.400
So long as you help me,

00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:41.120
I'll belong to you.

00:03:52.320 --> 00:03:54.480
This fellow student is talking nonsense.

00:03:54.560 --> 00:03:55.640
Has she lost her mind?

00:03:57.840 --> 00:03:58.960
Your Excellency, please see the truth.

00:03:59.720 --> 00:04:01.120
This woman's real name is Jiang Mei'er.

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:03.120
She is the niece of Shazhou's former governor

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:05.640
And was my classmate at the Shazhou Women's Academy.

00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:08.200
Back in Shazhou, she neglected her studies,

00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:10.800
Abused her power, and bullied her classmates.

00:04:10.880 --> 00:04:12.200
She may have changed her name today

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:13.280
And can deny everything,

00:04:13.840 --> 00:04:15.320
But since she placed first in the exam,

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:17.280
She must possess genuine learning.

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:18.800
I ask Your Excellency

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:20.840
To allow me and Scholar An

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:22.200
To debate the classics here and now.

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:27.880
Why have you all come here today?

00:04:28.520 --> 00:04:30.480
Wasn't it to seek justice?

00:04:30.560 --> 00:04:32.200
Then let us see for ourselves

00:04:32.280 --> 00:04:33.880
How much genuine learning

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:35.720
This top scholar truly possesses.

00:04:36.680 --> 00:04:37.560
Exactly!

00:04:37.640 --> 00:04:39.280
We want to see her true ability!

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:42.880
- Show us her true ability! - Show us her true ability!

00:04:44.560 --> 00:04:45.400
Very well.

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:47.520
I, too, have the highest regard

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:49.640
For people of genuine talent and learning.

00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:52.800
When a state prospers,

00:04:52.880 --> 00:04:54.160
It treats its people as if they were wounded.

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:55.120
That is its blessing.

00:04:55.680 --> 00:04:56.960
When it falls,

00:04:57.040 --> 00:04:58.600
It treats its people like dirt.

00:04:58.680 --> 00:04:59.640
That is its doom.

00:04:59.720 --> 00:05:01.680
Is that passage from the Book of Rites or the Book of Documents?

00:05:08.680 --> 00:05:10.400
The Book of Rites.

00:05:14.560 --> 00:05:16.480
No, the Book of Documents.

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:22.200
It's from the Zuo Commentary.

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:23.600
I simply

00:05:23.680 --> 00:05:24.920
Misremembered it for a moment.

00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:27.160
What can one stray quotation prove?

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:30.320
Did you all hear that clearly?

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:33.440
It is a passage known to every scholar,

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:35.000
Yet she claims she simply misremembered it.

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:36.960
How can someone so muddleheaded

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:38.080
Be the top metropolitan scholar?

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:39.680
Has the Great Ning imperial examination

00:05:39.760 --> 00:05:40.720
Become nothing but a farce?

00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:42.360
She's right!

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:44.520
She's right!

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:46.760
- She's right! - She's right!

00:05:46.840 --> 00:05:47.760
Your Excellency,

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:49.880
She did not write the winning essay.

00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:52.080
I beg you to see the truth.

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:53.000
Confucius said,

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:54.320
“To know what you know...”

00:05:54.400 --> 00:05:55.480
Your Excellency,

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:56.920
I studied bitterly for ten years

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:58.160
Before finally earning this distinction,

00:05:58.240 --> 00:06:00.200
Only to be slandered by her now.

00:06:00.280 --> 00:06:01.560
You must uphold justice for me!

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:05.080
Confucius said, “Observe what one does and examine why one does it.”

00:06:05.160 --> 00:06:08.080
Since she insists she wrote the winning essay,

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:10.480
Let us retest her on the same topic.

00:06:11.240 --> 00:06:12.880
I am willing to sit the test beside her.

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:15.560
The truth will be plain at a glance.

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:16.720
Your Excellency!

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:17.880
There's no need for another test.

00:06:18.360 --> 00:06:20.680
The words are there in black and white. I wrote them. There's no mistake.

00:06:21.240 --> 00:06:22.680
Will you let me

00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:23.640
Finish speaking?

00:06:23.720 --> 00:06:25.280
All this shouting—

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:26.440
Where is your decorum?

00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:28.840
This isn't the examination hall.

00:06:28.920 --> 00:06:30.120
There will be no test.

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:32.720
Do you truly think scholarly honors

00:06:32.800 --> 00:06:35.160
Can be twisted by a sharp tongue?

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:38.280
Jiang Mei'er,

00:06:38.360 --> 00:06:40.200
If I could get rid of your uncle,

00:06:40.720 --> 00:06:42.080
I can get rid of you too.

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:43.840
You should have seen

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:45.200
How horribly your uncle died.

00:06:46.360 --> 00:06:48.040
A crossbow bolt pierced his heart.

00:06:48.120 --> 00:06:49.120
He died instantly.

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:50.880
Let me guess

00:06:51.880 --> 00:06:54.120
How you stole my place as top scholar.

00:06:55.400 --> 00:06:57.720
Was it through your uncle's pathetic connections?

00:06:58.280 --> 00:06:59.280
Or did you

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:03.600
Make some filthy bargain behind closed doors?

00:07:05.080 --> 00:07:06.360
The thing you prize most

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:08.160
Is that pretty face of yours.

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:11.320
You call yourself the greatest beauty every day.

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:13.800
Could it be that you relied on this?

00:07:15.440 --> 00:07:17.160
“So long as you help me, Second Master,

00:07:18.680 --> 00:07:20.760
I'll belong to you.”

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:25.600
Shut your mouth!

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:28.680
Meng Tinghui!

00:07:29.680 --> 00:07:30.520
Silence!

00:07:31.080 --> 00:07:32.080
You lunatic!

00:07:33.320 --> 00:07:34.200
The hearing isn't over yet!

00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:35.200
Pull them apart!

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:36.160
Court is adjourned!

00:07:37.480 --> 00:07:38.560
The hearing isn't over!

00:07:43.280 --> 00:07:45.360
Meng Tinghui!

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:47.040
You took everything from me!

00:07:47.120 --> 00:07:48.200
I'll kill you!

00:07:50.600 --> 00:07:51.680
Your Excellency,

00:07:51.760 --> 00:07:52.880
You heard every word yourself.

00:07:52.960 --> 00:07:54.520
Isn't the truth clear enough?

00:07:56.880 --> 00:07:57.720
Guards!

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:00.040
Seize this fraud

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:02.480
Who stole another's honor!

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:18.880
So you're all birds of a feather,

00:08:18.960 --> 00:08:20.480
Colluding with one another.

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:22.160
In the examination halls,

00:08:23.160 --> 00:08:24.400
And even in this court,

00:08:25.080 --> 00:08:27.680
You're all wolves who devour people whole!

00:08:29.880 --> 00:08:31.720
Now you finally understand.

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:34.280
Unfortunately,

00:08:34.360 --> 00:08:35.640
It's too late.

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:38.960
Did you think gathering a mob of fools

00:08:39.040 --> 00:08:40.200
Would save you?

00:08:44.480 --> 00:08:46.520
In the end, you still fell into my hands.

00:08:47.240 --> 00:08:48.800
From this day forward,

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:50.280
In the women's imperial examination,

00:08:50.360 --> 00:08:53.480
The name Meng Tinghui will cease to exist.

00:08:58.520 --> 00:08:59.600
In this world,

00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:04.880
Those without shame

00:09:06.800 --> 00:09:08.680
Outlive those without fear.

00:09:09.240 --> 00:09:10.280
Meng Tinghui,

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:13.080
Whether in Shazhou

00:09:13.160 --> 00:09:14.200
Or here in the capital,

00:09:15.040 --> 00:09:16.760
Anything you cherish,

00:09:17.760 --> 00:09:20.200
I can destroy with ease.

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:21.760
Destroy it all!

00:09:28.120 --> 00:09:29.520
- Let go of me! - Pull them apart!

00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:31.440
If you ruin me, you won't live either!

00:09:35.680 --> 00:09:36.520
This is a court of law!

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:38.280
Your behavior disgraces all scholars!

00:09:39.040 --> 00:09:39.960
Confucius said,

00:09:40.040 --> 00:09:42.600
“In the practice of rites, harmony is most precious.”

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:44.000
Scholar Meng,

00:09:44.080 --> 00:09:48.200
You should confess to falsely accusing the top metropolitan scholar.

00:09:48.280 --> 00:09:51.120
I will spare your life.

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:52.200
Your Excellency,

00:09:52.280 --> 00:09:53.760
She caused this enormous scandal

00:09:53.840 --> 00:09:55.120
And nearly killed me.

00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:56.760
She cannot be allowed to live!

00:09:56.840 --> 00:09:57.720
The dispute over the true top scholar

00:09:57.800 --> 00:09:59.360
Is already known throughout the capital.

00:10:00.520 --> 00:10:01.800
If anything happens to me,

00:10:02.360 --> 00:10:04.520
It will only prove my accusation true.

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:07.360
Will you still be able to escape blame then?

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:08.840
Turn back before it's too late,

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:10.840
And you may yet save your life.

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:13.320
What a glib tongue.

00:10:13.400 --> 00:10:14.400
Your Excellency,

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:15.320
Have her arrested!

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:16.680
Confucius said,

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:18.640
“Do not meddle in matters outside your office.”

00:10:19.480 --> 00:10:20.880
I know how to handle this case.

00:10:20.960 --> 00:10:22.240
I need no instruction

00:10:22.320 --> 00:10:24.240
From Scholar An.

00:10:25.240 --> 00:10:26.200
Lock her in the dungeon.

00:10:31.360 --> 00:10:33.640
Your Excellency, the Tiger's Roar Gang is here.

00:10:55.800 --> 00:10:58.000
Second Master Lü. Scholar An.

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:09.920
Come here.

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:14.360
Governor Dong,

00:11:14.920 --> 00:11:16.800
What do you intend to do with Meng Tinghui?

00:11:18.040 --> 00:11:19.520
I have already made arrangements.

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:21.320
We will announce

00:11:21.400 --> 00:11:22.280
That Meng Tinghui

00:11:22.360 --> 00:11:24.320
Went mad after failing the examination.

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:26.120
We'll imprison her for a while,

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:27.240
Then, once the uproar dies down,

00:11:27.320 --> 00:11:29.160
Send her back to Shazhou.

00:11:29.720 --> 00:11:31.920
What a fine official you are.

00:11:33.400 --> 00:11:34.480
You flatter me, Scholar An.

00:11:34.560 --> 00:11:36.000
In my view,

00:11:36.080 --> 00:11:38.160
Killing Meng Tinghui

00:11:38.240 --> 00:11:40.040
Would only make the scandal worse.

00:11:40.600 --> 00:11:42.840
I am merely protecting the greater good.

00:11:46.240 --> 00:11:47.880
Second Master,

00:11:47.960 --> 00:11:49.040
You see?

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:52.240
He has no respect for you at all.

00:11:52.320 --> 00:11:54.160
He's leaving himself an escape route.

00:11:58.840 --> 00:11:59.840
Don't worry, Mei'er.

00:12:01.920 --> 00:12:03.720
I've invited Madam Dong

00:12:03.800 --> 00:12:04.960
And her child

00:12:05.520 --> 00:12:07.360
To take tea at the teahouse.

00:12:12.520 --> 00:12:14.120
What... What are you doing?

00:12:14.200 --> 00:12:15.520
What is the meaning of this?

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:18.640
I did everything you ordered.

00:12:18.720 --> 00:12:19.880
What more do you want from me?

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:21.760
I demand to see the chief.

00:12:27.560 --> 00:12:28.560
See the chief?

00:12:31.120 --> 00:12:33.080
Am I beneath you, then?

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:35.920
Dong Shoucai,

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:37.200
That official robe of yours

00:12:37.760 --> 00:12:39.840
Was given to you by the Tiger's Roar Gang.

00:12:39.920 --> 00:12:42.080
And you dare put on airs before me?

00:12:43.920 --> 00:12:44.840
Don't forget,

00:12:45.800 --> 00:12:47.120
The debt you owe for your official post

00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:48.080
Has yet to be repaid.

00:12:48.840 --> 00:12:50.440
If the chief learns of this,

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:52.720
You won't live much longer.

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:59.000
So think carefully, Governor.

00:12:59.680 --> 00:13:03.160
Do you want your wealth and status,

00:13:04.920 --> 00:13:06.800
Or do you want your family torn apart?

00:13:09.240 --> 00:13:10.360
I leave everything to you,

00:13:10.440 --> 00:13:11.520
Second Master and Scholar An.

00:13:26.040 --> 00:13:28.200
Arrest everyone involved

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:29.600
In the examination fraud

00:13:29.680 --> 00:13:31.880
And hold them for trial.

00:13:32.680 --> 00:13:33.840
Understood.

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:35.960
Take them away.

00:13:44.280 --> 00:13:45.160
Your Majesty,

00:13:45.240 --> 00:13:47.400
Sister Zhili ordered me to deliver this at once.

00:13:47.480 --> 00:13:48.560
It is a petition for justice

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:50.120
Written by the female scholar Meng Tinghui.

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:51.720
Countless copies have been printed

00:13:52.200 --> 00:13:54.200
And spread through every street in the capital.

00:13:58.280 --> 00:13:59.760
The fire she started

00:13:59.840 --> 00:14:01.400
Has spread fast and fiercely.

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:02.800
Where is she now?

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:04.760
At the Capital Prefecture office.

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:06.400
Go to the Capital Prefecture.

00:14:39.240 --> 00:14:40.080
Jiang Mei'er,

00:14:41.840 --> 00:14:43.520
You'd better kill me today.

00:14:44.640 --> 00:14:46.680
Otherwise, I'll make you wish you were dead.

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:48.680
Killing you with one stroke

00:14:49.640 --> 00:14:50.720
Would be no fun at all.

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:53.000
I want to torment you

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:54.440
Little by little until you die.

00:14:55.320 --> 00:14:58.360
I'll repay you a thousandfold.

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:10.560
Any last words?

00:15:12.360 --> 00:15:13.720
You brought this on yourself.

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:15.600
You deserve death a thousand times over.

00:15:15.680 --> 00:15:17.400
Sooner or later, you'll face retribution.

00:15:30.680 --> 00:15:32.040
She failed in her false accusation

00:15:32.120 --> 00:15:33.200
And killed herself out of guilt.

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:35.720
She burned the cell and died in the fire. Understood?

00:15:35.800 --> 00:15:36.880
- Yes. - Yes.

00:17:06.600 --> 00:17:08.120
Still trying to run?

00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:09.440
Meng Tinghui!

00:17:09.520 --> 00:17:11.400
You caused the deaths of hundreds of my Black Tiger Hall brothers.

00:17:11.480 --> 00:17:13.160
Today, you'll die with them!

00:17:16.080 --> 00:17:16.920
Meng Tinghui!

00:17:21.360 --> 00:17:22.200
Meng Tinghui!

00:17:23.240 --> 00:17:25.560
If even the fire couldn't kill you,

00:17:25.640 --> 00:17:28.080
I'll finish you myself.

00:17:34.720 --> 00:17:35.560
Fall back!

00:17:36.520 --> 00:17:38.280
Meng Tinghui, you lunatic!

00:18:19.480 --> 00:18:20.640
She's over there!

00:18:27.400 --> 00:18:28.640
I'll kill you!

00:18:32.360 --> 00:18:33.200
Retreat!

00:18:34.920 --> 00:18:36.000
After them!

00:18:57.880 --> 00:18:59.320
He Du!

00:18:59.400 --> 00:19:01.280
They're trying to kill me!

00:19:03.520 --> 00:19:04.720
Leave them to me.

00:19:16.560 --> 00:19:18.240
I, your humble servant Dong Shoucai,

00:19:18.880 --> 00:19:20.400
Studied diligently for ten years

00:19:21.280 --> 00:19:23.640
And upheld the teachings of the sages.

00:19:24.200 --> 00:19:25.720
The day my name appeared on the honor roll,

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:28.680
I swore before my own reflection

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:31.240
That I would be an honest official.

00:19:31.320 --> 00:19:33.280
But one wrong step

00:19:33.800 --> 00:19:35.240
Led me down a crooked path.

00:19:35.840 --> 00:19:39.120
I have lived half my life in fear and cowardice.

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:41.640
I deserve my punishment

00:19:42.440 --> 00:19:44.040
And deeply regret my choices.

00:19:45.000 --> 00:19:46.680
I am willing to die for my crimes.

00:19:47.600 --> 00:19:49.360
But my family is innocent.

00:19:50.360 --> 00:19:51.640
I beg Your Majesty

00:19:52.880 --> 00:19:54.760
To show them mercy.

00:20:20.120 --> 00:20:20.960
Miss Meng.

00:20:40.040 --> 00:20:42.320
Meng is merely an orphan from the streets.

00:20:42.400 --> 00:20:44.960
Why would His Majesty personally seek justice for her?

00:20:46.040 --> 00:20:48.000
So many noble ladies at court

00:20:48.080 --> 00:20:50.200
Long desperately for imperial favor,

00:20:50.280 --> 00:20:51.640
Yet he scarcely gives them a glance.

00:20:51.720 --> 00:20:53.960
Why does he care so much about her?

00:20:54.720 --> 00:20:56.880
His Majesty cares about the examination.

00:20:56.960 --> 00:20:58.120
This was the first imperial examination

00:20:58.200 --> 00:20:59.240
Since he ascended the throne,

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:01.320
And it was tainted by fraud.

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:02.720
By acting personally,

00:21:02.800 --> 00:21:04.480
He is showing the realm his resolve.

00:21:04.560 --> 00:21:06.480
Even so, she had no reason to enter the palace.

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:09.160
Since His Majesty was a child,

00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:12.320
No woman but you has ever been allowed to stay here.

00:21:12.800 --> 00:21:13.680
What worries me

00:21:13.760 --> 00:21:14.920
Is that she may want to remain here.

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:17.200
After all, that's far easier than passing the exam.

00:21:17.280 --> 00:21:18.640
He Du...

00:21:24.080 --> 00:21:24.920
Miss Meng.

00:21:28.680 --> 00:21:29.680
It's you.

00:21:30.400 --> 00:21:32.000
Where am I?

00:21:32.080 --> 00:21:34.120
Can't you tell? This is the imperial palace.

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:37.120
Actually, I wanted to ask you something.

00:21:37.200 --> 00:21:38.200
Back in Shazhou,

00:21:38.280 --> 00:21:40.640
What exactly happened between you and His Majesty?

00:21:40.720 --> 00:21:41.680
Chief Steward You,

00:21:41.760 --> 00:21:43.160
As I was leaving just now,

00:21:43.240 --> 00:21:44.480
I heard His Majesty say he wanted some soup.

00:21:44.560 --> 00:21:45.920
You should go check on him.

00:21:46.640 --> 00:21:47.480
All right.

00:21:52.040 --> 00:21:52.960
Miss Meng,

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:54.440
You're finally awake.

00:21:54.520 --> 00:21:55.840
His Majesty saved you.

00:21:55.920 --> 00:21:57.400
You've been unconscious for two days,

00:21:57.480 --> 00:21:58.760
With a fever that wouldn't break.

00:21:58.840 --> 00:22:00.280
Do you feel any better now?

00:22:03.720 --> 00:22:04.960
The imperial physician prescribed this

00:22:05.040 --> 00:22:06.400
To ease the fever and restore your strength.

00:22:06.480 --> 00:22:07.520
Drink it while it's warm.

00:22:09.720 --> 00:22:11.560
He really is the emperor.

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:15.000
Who would have thought

00:22:15.640 --> 00:22:17.720
That after our brief meeting outside the exam hall,

00:22:18.280 --> 00:22:20.640
We would meet again here in the palace?

00:22:21.560 --> 00:22:22.840
Thank you for taking care of me.

00:22:22.920 --> 00:22:24.120
No need to thank me.

00:22:25.000 --> 00:22:26.480
During the metropolitan exam,

00:22:26.560 --> 00:22:28.040
I thought I might place first.

00:22:28.600 --> 00:22:30.240
I never imagined someone could surpass me.

00:22:30.320 --> 00:22:33.000
After reading your policy essay, I couldn't sleep all night.

00:22:33.560 --> 00:22:36.120
I only wished to meet its author soon.

00:22:36.200 --> 00:22:37.640
I never imagined it would be you, Miss Meng.

00:22:37.720 --> 00:22:38.880
I couldn't be happier.

00:22:41.160 --> 00:22:42.160
Do you know

00:22:42.800 --> 00:22:44.160
How Miss Yan is doing now?

00:22:44.240 --> 00:22:45.360
Don't worry.

00:22:45.440 --> 00:22:47.400
She was sent back to Spring Blossom House

00:22:47.480 --> 00:22:48.560
And is perfectly safe.

00:22:49.360 --> 00:22:50.320
Drink it while it's warm.

00:22:53.720 --> 00:22:55.080
When I heard what happened to you,

00:22:55.160 --> 00:22:56.920
I was shaken to the core.

00:22:57.640 --> 00:22:59.360
Thankfully, you fought back brilliantly

00:22:59.440 --> 00:23:00.800
And stopped them from succeeding.

00:23:00.880 --> 00:23:02.320
Everything is all right now.

00:23:02.400 --> 00:23:03.360
His Majesty not only restored

00:23:03.440 --> 00:23:04.760
Your title as top metropolitan scholar,

00:23:04.840 --> 00:23:06.520
He also threw Jiang Mei'er into prison.

00:23:06.600 --> 00:23:08.160
It is truly satisfying.

00:23:09.440 --> 00:23:11.160
Has His Majesty visited these past few days?

00:23:11.240 --> 00:23:12.520
No.

00:23:12.600 --> 00:23:14.080
After such a major incident,

00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:15.320
His Majesty has been very busy.

00:23:15.880 --> 00:23:17.440
But he instructed me

00:23:17.520 --> 00:23:18.720
To take good care of you.

00:23:18.800 --> 00:23:22.280
- May I go see His Majesty? - You should rest and recover first.

00:23:22.360 --> 00:23:23.280
Whatever you need,

00:23:23.360 --> 00:23:24.840
I can relay it for you.

00:23:24.920 --> 00:23:26.000
I want to visit the Ministry of Justice.

00:23:42.600 --> 00:23:43.760
Guard Huang.

00:23:44.960 --> 00:23:46.200
Guard Huang.

00:23:46.280 --> 00:23:47.840
I want to speak with her alone.

00:24:05.080 --> 00:24:07.840
Tell me. How did you get close to Lü Er,

00:24:08.320 --> 00:24:09.480
Bribe the examiners,

00:24:10.120 --> 00:24:11.000
And arrange the fire to kill me?

00:24:12.280 --> 00:24:13.160
You're no

00:24:13.800 --> 00:24:15.200
Better than I am.

00:24:16.640 --> 00:24:17.480
You're only able

00:24:17.560 --> 00:24:19.000
To stand before me

00:24:19.080 --> 00:24:20.960
Because you climbed into the emperor's bed.

00:24:21.520 --> 00:24:22.760
Without a man,

00:24:23.320 --> 00:24:24.840
You're nothing.

00:24:28.880 --> 00:24:30.000
Meng Tinghui,

00:24:31.160 --> 00:24:33.000
You're still so arrogant,

00:24:33.080 --> 00:24:34.600
So full of yourself.

00:24:34.680 --> 00:24:36.840
Do you know what I hate most about you?

00:24:38.720 --> 00:24:40.400
Those eyes of yours.

00:24:41.400 --> 00:24:42.400
You're nothing but

00:24:42.480 --> 00:24:44.160
A lowborn orphan.

00:24:44.240 --> 00:24:46.160
What gives you the right to look at me that way?

00:24:48.120 --> 00:24:48.960
I, Jiang Mei'er,

00:24:50.360 --> 00:24:51.840
Was born into a distinguished family

00:24:52.360 --> 00:24:53.840
And blessed with peerless beauty.

00:24:55.760 --> 00:24:58.560
I could have had endless glory.

00:25:00.160 --> 00:25:01.320
But because of you—

00:25:02.960 --> 00:25:05.680
You drove me to this.

00:25:05.760 --> 00:25:07.760
You forced me to try to eliminate you.

00:25:08.760 --> 00:25:11.120
How far must you go to destroy me?

00:25:11.200 --> 00:25:13.680
You have always been the one destroying yourself.

00:25:14.600 --> 00:25:16.640
You used your family status to act above the law,

00:25:17.240 --> 00:25:18.560
And with power in your hands,

00:25:19.040 --> 00:25:20.680
You did nothing but oppress the innocent.

00:25:20.760 --> 00:25:22.320
Your jealousy,

00:25:22.400 --> 00:25:23.680
Greed, and delusions

00:25:23.760 --> 00:25:25.120
Were what drove you into the abyss.

00:25:25.840 --> 00:25:27.600
If you confess everything truthfully,

00:25:28.240 --> 00:25:29.720
Your sentence may be reduced.

00:25:30.280 --> 00:25:32.560
But you will only get one chance.

00:25:39.000 --> 00:25:39.880
Meng Tinghui,

00:25:40.400 --> 00:25:42.760
Can you claim you have no ambition?

00:25:43.360 --> 00:25:45.840
Can you claim you don't want to rise higher?

00:25:46.480 --> 00:25:48.800
We're exactly the same.

00:25:49.800 --> 00:25:51.200
You're simply

00:25:51.280 --> 00:25:53.560
Better at pretending than I am.

00:25:54.520 --> 00:25:56.840
Now you falsely claim you'll spare me.

00:25:57.760 --> 00:25:59.720
Do you even believe your own lies?

00:25:59.800 --> 00:26:02.000
We were never the same kind of person.

00:26:03.000 --> 00:26:04.080
But you were right about one thing.

00:26:06.720 --> 00:26:08.760
I do intend to rise.

00:26:09.760 --> 00:26:11.240
And now I have risen to a position

00:26:11.320 --> 00:26:13.480
Where your life and death are mine to decide.

00:26:14.480 --> 00:26:15.320
I won't write it.

00:26:16.880 --> 00:26:18.480
Since you don't want this chance,

00:26:20.040 --> 00:26:21.080
Then forget it.

00:26:28.320 --> 00:26:29.160
Meng Tinghui!

00:26:29.760 --> 00:26:30.600
I'll write it!

00:26:31.440 --> 00:26:32.400
I'll write!

00:26:32.480 --> 00:26:34.400
As long as you spare me,

00:26:34.480 --> 00:26:35.720
I'll do anything.

00:26:42.320 --> 00:26:43.400
My mother told me

00:26:44.080 --> 00:26:45.400
I must survive.

00:26:47.360 --> 00:26:48.560
I must survive.

00:26:49.800 --> 00:26:50.760
Only by staying alive

00:26:50.840 --> 00:26:53.080
Can I start everything over.

00:26:59.320 --> 00:27:00.880
I want to live.

00:27:02.720 --> 00:27:04.200
I want to live!

00:27:19.360 --> 00:27:20.880
The Tiger's Roar Gang's second-in-command

00:27:21.880 --> 00:27:23.560
Is known as Second Master Lü.

00:27:24.040 --> 00:27:27.520
Black Tiger Hall in Shazhou is only one of the gang's branches.

00:27:27.600 --> 00:27:28.600
I'll confess everything.

00:27:29.360 --> 00:27:31.080
You said my sentence would be reduced.

00:27:33.120 --> 00:27:33.960
It will.

00:27:35.320 --> 00:27:36.720
Your crimes are monstrous.

00:27:37.360 --> 00:27:39.080
You should have been sentenced to death by a thousand cuts.

00:27:39.640 --> 00:27:41.760
His Majesty has granted you a swift death.

00:27:41.840 --> 00:27:43.200
That is the greatest mercy you could receive.

00:27:44.280 --> 00:27:46.240
Meng Tinghui,

00:27:46.320 --> 00:27:48.960
I was wrong.

00:27:49.040 --> 00:27:50.520
I'm begging you.

00:27:51.040 --> 00:27:54.880
- Please, spare me! - Jiang Mei'er.

00:27:54.960 --> 00:27:57.760
I came today to see you on your final journey.

00:27:58.320 --> 00:28:00.520
I may have harmed you,

00:28:00.600 --> 00:28:01.880
But now,

00:28:01.960 --> 00:28:03.920
Aren't you standing here unharmed?

00:28:04.480 --> 00:28:06.520
And you've even won His Majesty's favor.

00:28:06.600 --> 00:28:07.680
For such tremendous good fortune,

00:28:07.760 --> 00:28:09.960
Surely I deserve some credit.

00:28:11.240 --> 00:28:13.000
White silk or poisoned wine.

00:28:13.800 --> 00:28:14.880
Choose for yourself.

00:28:26.960 --> 00:28:29.520
Meng Tinghui, you liar!

00:28:29.600 --> 00:28:31.200
You'll die a horrible death!

00:28:31.280 --> 00:28:33.480
The Tiger's Roar Gang will never spare you!

00:28:33.560 --> 00:28:35.800
Even as a ghost, I'll come for you!

00:28:36.600 --> 00:28:38.680
I'm only afraid they won't dare come.

00:28:39.960 --> 00:28:41.200
Anyone who harmed me—

00:28:43.040 --> 00:28:45.000
I won't spare a single one.

00:30:09.200 --> 00:30:10.840
Aren't the women at Warm Fragrance Pavilion

00:30:11.400 --> 00:30:12.560
Enough to satisfy you?

00:30:12.640 --> 00:30:13.560
Chief, I was wrong!

00:30:14.160 --> 00:30:15.280
Dong Shoucai killed himself out of guilt.

00:30:15.360 --> 00:30:17.320
Don't worry. He didn't reveal

00:30:17.400 --> 00:30:18.680
A single thing about our gang.

00:30:19.240 --> 00:30:20.080
Chief!

00:30:23.720 --> 00:30:25.320
Brother!

00:30:25.400 --> 00:30:26.240
I was wrong, Brother!

00:30:26.320 --> 00:30:28.080
I truly was wrong!

00:30:28.160 --> 00:30:29.280
Spare me, Brother!

00:30:29.880 --> 00:30:30.720
Brother!

00:30:31.520 --> 00:30:32.880
Were you born yesterday?

00:30:32.960 --> 00:30:35.280
That little bitch already betrayed you.

00:30:35.360 --> 00:30:37.880
Brother, I was blinded by that bitch.

00:30:37.960 --> 00:30:38.800
But all I wanted

00:30:38.880 --> 00:30:41.360
Was to find Meng Tinghui and avenge you, Brother!

00:30:41.920 --> 00:30:43.480
- Chief! - Get up.

00:30:43.560 --> 00:30:45.400
- Brother! - You let lust cloud your judgment.

00:30:45.480 --> 00:30:46.720
You were used,

00:30:46.800 --> 00:30:48.080
And you call that avenging me?

00:30:48.840 --> 00:30:51.000
“We fear no court official in life,

00:30:51.080 --> 00:30:53.160
Nor King Yama in death.”

00:30:53.840 --> 00:30:56.800
- Chief... - You're more imposing than I am.

00:30:56.880 --> 00:30:58.720
Chief, spare my life!

00:31:01.600 --> 00:31:02.760
Come here.

00:31:02.840 --> 00:31:03.680
Brother!

00:31:06.120 --> 00:31:07.000
Brother!

00:31:07.080 --> 00:31:08.640
I'm your own brother!

00:31:08.720 --> 00:31:09.840
Shut up!

00:31:09.920 --> 00:31:12.320
I don't want to die! I'm your brother!

00:31:12.400 --> 00:31:13.240
Brother!

00:31:13.320 --> 00:31:14.160
Brother!

00:31:23.680 --> 00:31:24.680
Chief,

00:31:24.760 --> 00:31:26.120
This punishment

00:31:26.200 --> 00:31:27.800
Will surely teach him a lasting lesson.

00:31:27.880 --> 00:31:29.040
I beg you

00:31:29.120 --> 00:31:31.080
To let him remain in the gang and serve you,

00:31:31.760 --> 00:31:32.880
So he can redeem himself through merit.

00:31:42.280 --> 00:31:45.120
It took the Tiger's Roar Gang ten years

00:31:46.400 --> 00:31:48.920
To build this power in the capital.

00:31:51.280 --> 00:31:53.360
Now, because of him alone,

00:31:54.760 --> 00:31:56.960
We're being hunted by soldiers across the city.

00:31:57.040 --> 00:31:58.920
Even His Majesty has been alerted.

00:31:59.000 --> 00:32:00.360
If we didn't have someone protecting us at court,

00:32:01.040 --> 00:32:02.920
The entire gang would have died with you.

00:32:03.000 --> 00:32:05.160
Please don't, Chief!

00:32:05.920 --> 00:32:07.160
I failed to discipline him.

00:32:12.040 --> 00:32:12.920
Chief,

00:32:13.000 --> 00:32:14.680
For the sake of the two of us

00:32:14.760 --> 00:32:16.240
Serving you for over ten years,

00:32:16.320 --> 00:32:17.680
Please spare his life.

00:32:18.240 --> 00:32:19.240
I beg you.

00:32:28.440 --> 00:32:29.880
Keep your heads down for now.

00:32:29.960 --> 00:32:31.400
Don't cause me any more trouble.

00:32:31.480 --> 00:32:32.760
- Yes. - Yes.

00:32:32.840 --> 00:32:34.640
- Thank you for sparing me, Chief! - Get out!

00:32:46.000 --> 00:32:48.080
(The Tiger's Roar Gang must lie low and keep silent.)

00:32:48.160 --> 00:32:50.040
(Not a single trace of us may be exposed.)

00:33:20.520 --> 00:33:21.560
Chief.

00:33:22.040 --> 00:33:22.960
Sit down.

00:33:29.960 --> 00:33:30.840
Your brother...

00:33:31.520 --> 00:33:33.000
He's fine. He only lost some flesh.

00:33:33.080 --> 00:33:34.760
The bone wasn't damaged. He'll live.

00:33:35.360 --> 00:33:36.440
Keep a close eye on him.

00:33:36.520 --> 00:33:38.280
The court refuses to let this go.

00:33:38.920 --> 00:33:39.840
He has a reckless temper.

00:33:39.920 --> 00:33:41.120
If he charges outside again,

00:33:42.000 --> 00:33:43.080
He won't be so lucky next time.

00:33:43.760 --> 00:33:45.920
Don't worry, Chief. If he acts rashly again,

00:33:46.000 --> 00:33:46.840
There'll be no need for gang discipline.

00:33:46.920 --> 00:33:48.240
I'll break both his legs myself.

00:33:52.840 --> 00:33:54.120
I had Old Li make this for you.

00:33:55.520 --> 00:33:56.640
I don't know whether it fits.

00:34:04.120 --> 00:34:05.240
Don't be so impulsive again.

00:34:18.480 --> 00:34:19.360
Miss Meng,

00:34:19.440 --> 00:34:21.360
Your complexion looks much better than before.

00:34:21.440 --> 00:34:22.560
You still need plenty of rest.

00:34:23.280 --> 00:34:24.480
I've already rested for many days.

00:34:25.800 --> 00:34:27.240
I'd like to go outside for a walk.

00:34:28.040 --> 00:34:30.240
I hear the imperial garden is beautiful.

00:34:31.440 --> 00:34:33.720
Does His Majesty often visit it?

00:34:34.520 --> 00:34:36.200
When His Majesty takes a break from memorials,

00:34:36.280 --> 00:34:37.560
He occasionally rests there for a while.

00:34:43.240 --> 00:34:45.200
Miss Meng, you should get some rest.

00:34:50.080 --> 00:34:51.560
I have fully recovered.

00:34:52.720 --> 00:34:53.960
The palace examination is approaching.

00:34:54.880 --> 00:34:56.960
I must seize the opportunity before me.

00:35:02.120 --> 00:35:03.840
This was my mother's favorite flower.

00:35:06.360 --> 00:35:07.240
What a pity.

00:35:08.560 --> 00:35:10.200
Fine flowers cannot grow in rotten soil.

00:35:11.360 --> 00:35:12.200
Huang Bo.

00:35:13.000 --> 00:35:15.360
- Bring another fresh seedling. - Yes.

00:35:30.400 --> 00:35:32.160
I summoned you today, Grand Tutor,

00:35:32.240 --> 00:35:33.520
To discuss a matter.

00:35:34.480 --> 00:35:36.320
I intend to establish a Bureau of Inquiry,

00:35:36.400 --> 00:35:38.040
Independent of both chancellors and the Six Ministries.

00:35:38.120 --> 00:35:39.440
It will investigate officials above,

00:35:39.520 --> 00:35:40.840
Eradicate criminal forces below,

00:35:40.920 --> 00:35:42.120
And report directly to the throne.

00:35:43.760 --> 00:35:44.600
Your Majesty.

00:35:45.680 --> 00:35:46.560
Come.

00:35:50.200 --> 00:35:52.200
If Your Majesty wishes to cultivate new talent,

00:35:53.560 --> 00:35:55.520
These young seedlings may be free of pests,

00:35:55.600 --> 00:35:56.840
But their roots are still shallow.

00:35:57.600 --> 00:35:58.760
They cannot withstand storms.

00:36:06.000 --> 00:36:07.080
The Bureau of Inquiry...

00:36:08.080 --> 00:36:10.880
Is Scholar Meng still recuperating in the palace?

00:36:10.960 --> 00:36:11.800
Naturally.

00:36:11.880 --> 00:36:13.040
His Majesty has shown great tenderness toward her.

00:36:13.120 --> 00:36:14.640
Imperial physicians, tonics—

00:36:14.720 --> 00:36:16.160
He has spared no care at all.

00:36:22.520 --> 00:36:23.440
The Left Chancellor

00:36:23.520 --> 00:36:25.440
Is watching the aftermath of the women's exam closely.

00:36:25.520 --> 00:36:27.280
For His Majesty to bring Scholar Meng into the palace now...

00:36:27.360 --> 00:36:28.920
- I'm afraid... - The new scholars will enter court

00:36:29.000 --> 00:36:31.520
Precisely to counterbalance the Left Chancellor.

00:36:33.360 --> 00:36:34.760
The Ministry of Rites failed in its duty,

00:36:34.840 --> 00:36:36.720
Causing Scholar Meng both physical and emotional harm.

00:36:37.240 --> 00:36:38.440
The palace examination is near.

00:36:38.520 --> 00:36:40.880
I merely wished for her to recover soon

00:36:40.960 --> 00:36:42.440
And prepare for the exam in peace.

00:36:44.400 --> 00:36:45.520
Your Majesty,

00:36:45.600 --> 00:36:47.160
If Scholar Meng remains in the palace too long,

00:36:47.240 --> 00:36:48.400
People will inevitably gossip.

00:36:49.280 --> 00:36:50.160
The Left Chancellor's faction

00:36:50.240 --> 00:36:51.480
Is already watching for an opening.

00:36:52.440 --> 00:36:54.240
If they exploit this matter,

00:36:54.320 --> 00:36:56.360
It may damage Your Majesty's reputation

00:36:56.440 --> 00:36:58.240
And jeopardize Miss Meng's future.

00:37:04.240 --> 00:37:05.720
Your counsel is sound, Grand Tutor.

00:37:05.800 --> 00:37:08.360
Have the imperial physician examine her again.

00:37:08.920 --> 00:37:11.040
If she is well, send her from the palace at once.

00:38:02.280 --> 00:38:03.560
The world lies shrouded in darkness.

00:38:04.680 --> 00:38:05.800
The long night has yet to end.

00:38:12.440 --> 00:38:14.120
Heaven shows no mercy.

00:38:15.480 --> 00:38:16.920
Tears stain my robes.

00:38:17.000 --> 00:38:17.840
Your Majesty,

00:38:18.400 --> 00:38:19.400
Shall I stop her?

00:38:20.120 --> 00:38:21.440
Let her vent her pain.

00:38:26.320 --> 00:38:28.160
Fierce winds and sudden rain—

00:38:28.840 --> 00:38:30.360
What is there to fear?

00:38:31.880 --> 00:38:35.480
With sword in hand, I strike demons down!

00:38:38.280 --> 00:38:39.200
Scholar Meng's nature

00:38:39.280 --> 00:38:40.680
Has the wildness of Shazhou in it.

00:38:40.760 --> 00:38:41.960
Your Majesty should have seen her.

00:38:42.040 --> 00:38:43.760
She was formidable during the interrogation too.

00:38:43.880 --> 00:38:45.560
Jiang Mei'er confessed within moments.

00:38:45.640 --> 00:38:46.520
She was never an ordinary woman.

00:38:47.240 --> 00:38:48.360
This ordeal

00:38:48.880 --> 00:38:51.080
Will only make her more resolute.

00:38:53.280 --> 00:38:54.160
Her next step

00:38:55.800 --> 00:38:58.640
Will be to find someone powerful to rely on.

00:38:59.440 --> 00:39:00.280
Your Majesty,

00:39:00.960 --> 00:39:02.560
Scholar Meng has only just recovered.

00:39:02.640 --> 00:39:05.040
If she stays in the rain, she may fall ill and miss the palace examination.

00:39:05.880 --> 00:39:08.040
Perhaps I should take her back first.

00:39:23.320 --> 00:39:25.080
Why are you tormenting yourself?

00:39:30.000 --> 00:39:31.120
He Du...

00:39:39.480 --> 00:39:40.520
Your Majesty, don't worry.

00:39:41.200 --> 00:39:43.000
Scholar Meng has only caught a chill.

00:39:43.080 --> 00:39:44.120
It is nothing serious.

00:39:44.600 --> 00:39:45.440
Once she sobers up,

00:39:45.520 --> 00:39:47.560
A dose of cold medicine will cure her.

00:39:48.120 --> 00:39:49.240
You may leave.

00:39:49.320 --> 00:39:50.160
Yes.

00:39:56.600 --> 00:39:57.720
Your Majesty,

00:39:57.800 --> 00:39:58.760
Since she is in no danger

00:39:58.840 --> 00:39:59.840
And it is already late,

00:39:59.920 --> 00:40:01.440
We should return first.

00:40:07.160 --> 00:40:08.200
He Du...

00:40:25.920 --> 00:40:27.000
No need for ceremony.

00:40:28.840 --> 00:40:29.800
No.

00:40:30.240 --> 00:40:31.360
You are the emperor.

00:40:32.440 --> 00:40:33.800
I must pay my respects.

00:40:36.280 --> 00:40:38.800
This student greets Your Majesty.

00:40:44.760 --> 00:40:46.080
You may leave.

00:40:46.160 --> 00:40:48.120
- Your Majesty... - I know what I am doing.

00:41:06.640 --> 00:41:08.080
I never imagined

00:41:08.160 --> 00:41:11.200
That He Du, who faced life and death with me in Shazhou,

00:41:13.040 --> 00:41:14.640
Was actually His Majesty.

00:41:15.960 --> 00:41:17.520
That day at the Capital Prefecture,

00:41:17.600 --> 00:41:19.400
If His Majesty had not arrived in time,

00:41:20.040 --> 00:41:21.120
By now

00:41:22.440 --> 00:41:24.360
Not even my body would have remained intact.

00:41:36.840 --> 00:41:38.680
Thank you, Your Majesty, for saving my life.

00:41:39.160 --> 00:41:40.080
I

00:41:40.880 --> 00:41:42.560
Do not know how I can repay you.

00:41:53.520 --> 00:41:54.920
The examination fraud

00:41:55.000 --> 00:41:56.280
And the Ministry of Rites' failure

00:41:56.360 --> 00:41:57.400
Were my responsibility.

00:41:57.960 --> 00:41:58.960
You have suffered because of me.

00:41:59.640 --> 00:42:01.000
If you truly wish to repay me,

00:42:01.680 --> 00:42:03.760
Then stop abusing your health.

00:42:04.360 --> 00:42:05.720
Do well in the examination.

00:42:05.800 --> 00:42:07.440
I remember that in Shazhou,

00:42:08.600 --> 00:42:10.360
Your Majesty offered me an opportunity,

00:42:10.440 --> 00:42:13.400
But I rejected your kindness.

00:42:14.560 --> 00:42:16.000
Now I understand.

00:42:16.080 --> 00:42:17.400
In this world that devours people,

00:42:17.960 --> 00:42:20.880
Being high-minded can cost you your life.

00:42:21.680 --> 00:42:23.080
I'm so afraid.

00:42:23.160 --> 00:42:24.360
Afraid that one day,

00:42:25.600 --> 00:42:27.520
Even Your Majesty will be unable to protect me.

00:42:31.444 --> 00:42:35.444
MkvDrama.Net

